  SECTION 6 — EXPECTED OUTPUT
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  OUTPUT TYPE         DESCRIPTION
  ──────────────────  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Chat Answer         Natural language response from LLM, grounded in retrieved
                      context; includes expandable source citations with document
                      name and page number

  Practice Quiz       Interactive multiple-choice quiz (up to 10 MCQs) with
                      four options per question, automatic grading, and score
                      display (e.g., "Your Score: 4 / 5")

  Flashcard Deck      A set of question-answer / term-definition cards displayed
                      in an expandable interactive card format (up to 15 cards)

  Topic Summary       A structured revision guide with a summary paragraph
                      and bullet-point key takeaways for a given topic/chapter

  Study History       Persistent JSON log of all past quizzes, flashcard decks,
                      summaries, and chat sessions; filterable by activity type;
                      individual entries can be deleted


