  CURRENT IMPLEMENTATION STATUS
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  The following components are fully implemented and functional in the codebase:

  STATUS  MODULE / FEATURE
  ──────  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [DONE]  PDF Ingestion Pipeline
          PDF upload, text extraction (PyMuPDF), document cleaning,
          recursive character-based chunking with configurable parameters

  [DONE]  Embedding Pipeline
          HuggingFace embedding model management (EmbeddingManager)
          Support for two models: all-MiniLM-L6-v2 and BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

  [DONE]  Vector Store Layer
          Full FAISS and ChromaDB implementations with add, save, load,
          reset, and similarity-search-with-scores operations
          VectorStoreManager factory abstraction to switch providers

  [DONE]  Retrieval Pipeline
          Query preprocessing, vector similarity search, score normalization
          and threshold filtering, structured result format with timing metrics

  [DONE]  RAG Pipeline (End-to-End)
          Full pipeline: retrieval → prompt formatting → LLM generation
          via LangChain LCEL; anti-hallucination fallback implemented

  [DONE]  LLM Manager
          Multi-provider initialization: Groq, OpenAI, and Ollama
          API key management and Groq model name mapping

  [DONE]  Prompt Templates
          4 distinct system prompts: RAG Q&A, quiz generation,
          flashcard generation, and topic summary

  [DONE]  Study Generators
          Background-threaded generation of MCQ quizzes, flashcard decks,
          and topic summaries with LLM JSON output cleanup

  [DONE]  Streamlit Web UI (6 Pages)
          Study Library, Ask Questions, Practice Quiz, Flashcards,
          Topic Summaries, Study History
          Dark/light theme toggle, source-specific filtering

  [DONE]  Study History Manager
          JSON-based persistent history for all activity types:
          chat, quiz, flashcard, summary, library actions

  [DONE]  Evaluation Module
          Precision@K, Recall@K, and Hit Rate@K metric implementations

  [DONE]  Test Suite
          9 pytest unit test files covering all major modules


