  POSSIBLE NEXT STEPS (Post Milestone 1)
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  PRIORITY  NEXT STEP
  ────────  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  HIGH      1. Structured LLM Output with Pydantic Validation
               Replace raw JSON parsing for quiz/flashcard generation with
               LangChain's with_structured_output() + Pydantic models to
               guarantee well-formed outputs and eliminate JSON parse failures

  HIGH      2. Evaluation Dashboard
               Build an interactive evaluation page using retrieval_metrics.py
               and Plotly to visualize Precision@K, Recall@K, Hit Rate@K
               across different chunking strategies and embedding models

  MEDIUM    3. Support for Additional Document Types
               Extend the ingestion pipeline to support .docx, .pptx, and
               .txt files, broadening the range of uploadable study materials

  MEDIUM    4. Conversational Memory (Multi-turn Chat)
               Implement LangChain ConversationBufferMemory to maintain context
               across follow-up questions within a single session

  LOW       5. Semantic Chunking Strategy
               Replace RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter with a semantic chunking
               approach (e.g., LangChain SemanticChunker) that splits on
               meaning boundaries rather than character count


